WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Overview: search, categories and working previews.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.000
Guide: browse, choose a palette, preview motion and reuse Rust components.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Foundations: semantic colors, typography, spacing and exports.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Motion Lab: easing, scrubbing, springs and choreography.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
82 animated native vector icons, search and copy controls.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Components: actions, menus, tabs and retained choices.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
Primitives: disclosures, sorting, pinning, counters and cards.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Navigation: menus, picker, tree, pagination, wizard and carousel.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Forms: validation, codes, passwords, ranges and local files.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Charts trace their final geometry and expose linked values.

00:44.000 --> 00:46.000
Mono and dark mode: the native reveal includes the background.

00:46.000 --> 00:50.000
Overlays: dialogs, drawers, sheets, menus and feedback.

00:50.000 --> 00:56.000
Local coding workspace: source, diffs, CI checks, logs, chat and review.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
Return to Overview and the light Color palette.
